  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecumenical Accompaniment Programme (EAPPI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging ecumenical accompaniers, the initiative protects people and communities at risk of violence through the protective presence of ecumenical accompaniers, including Norwegian ones. The ecumenical accompaniers ensure credible on-the-ground monitoring of human rights violations and provide immediate reports to relevant stakeholders and monitoring systems. They constitute the largest group of international observers on the occupied West Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
